  <link:footnoteLink xlink:type="extended" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/link">
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HH0C3A2FD04307328532DD0B769DD5C856" xlink:label="HH0C3A2FD04307328532DD0B769DD5C856" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HH37CC5F3D42EDD39572A3E169064E749E" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <div>
          <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:115%">NEXUS Gas Transmission L.L.C. estimates 100% of the deferred income taxes reported in the beginning-of-year and end-of-year balances for Accumulated Deferred Taxes-Other (Account 282) could be included in the development of jurisdictional recourse rates, with the exception that approximately $117,033,731 (end-of-year balance), which is attributable to certain recent accelerated depreciation, would be excluded. Furthermore, as stated in paragraph III G. 3 of Order No. 710, Docket No. RM07-9-000 as issued on March 21, 2008 by the Federal Energy Regulatory Commission, these estimates are not binding on the pipeline at such time as it may file a section 4 rate case.</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
