    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HHA4CD6CAE657E412A1F53CF1ED4344ED2" xlink:to="HHAC77BE0EE309F080AE00653844237A40" order="1" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HH1ABFB945722FE97E386C71FAE14BEFBC" xlink:label="HH1ABFB945722FE97E386C71FAE14BEFBC" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HH71444C98C3F4A62143ACCB904C6F490C" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>Docket No. RM95-4-000 Order 581 issued September 28, 1995.</p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HH1ABFB945722FE97E386C71FAE14BEFBC" xlink:to="HH71444C98C3F4A62143ACCB904C6F490C" order="1" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HH63E4F1D077A81C870322F9C7CEE3207E" xlink:label="HH63E4F1D077A81C870322F9C7CEE3207E" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HH6A284717843764A07C2C5AE8ECFE4DCE" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
Throughput volumes are reported on contracts with discounted or negotiated commodity rates.</div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HH63E4F1D077A81C870322F9C7CEE3207E" xlink:to="HH6A284717843764A07C2C5AE8ECFE4DCE" order="1" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HH62DA866284BBF9BF23DB1F19B732C9FD" xlink:label="HH62DA866284BBF9BF23DB1F19B732C9FD" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HH191CF4337D26E2A7DC62DA3ECBBA5FCB" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>Loss and Unaccounted For (LAUF).&#160;</p>
        <p>LAUF incurred in the operation of the pipeline is tracked and flowed through to customers.&#160;</p>
        <p>LAUF amounts are recorded as a debit to account 813-Other Gas Supply Expense and a credit to account 812-Gas Used for Other Operations.</p>
        <p>&#160;</p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HH62DA866284BBF9BF23DB1F19B732C9FD" xlink:to="HH191CF4337D26E2A7DC62DA3ECBBA5FCB" order="1" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HH203496D1ABEE60BBA9E8071BBA7FD95C" xlink:label="HH203496D1ABEE60BBA9E8071BBA7FD95C" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HH01AB4FA36A8F03D3B00B3C200AAFA3FA" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>Loss and Unaccounted For (LAUF).&#160;</p>
        <p>LAUF incurred in the operation of the pipeline is tracked and flowed through to customers.&#160;</p>
        <p>LAUF amounts are recorded as a debit to account 813-Other Gas Supply Expense and a credit to account 812-Gas Used for Other Operations.</p>
        <p>&#160;</p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HH203496D1ABEE60BBA9E8071BBA7FD95C" xlink:to="HH01AB4FA36A8F03D3B00B3C200AAFA3FA" order="1" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HH7633CD4E75A567054BBBE78A1D58F688" xlink:label="HH7633CD4E75A567054BBBE78A1D58F688" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HHD2FA24923ABB0B2BFAF3F08F6DC94239" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>Fuel quantities requiring an allocation are assigned to the rate categories on the basis of the stated fuel rates as referenced in Order No. 710-C, at paragraph 9.&#160; Specifically, within each functional category, the fuel quantities in lines 8 &#8211; 30 are prorated to the rate categories based on the ratio of the Shipper Supplied quantities in lines 1 - 7 for each rate category to the total Shipper Supplied quantity for such functional category.</p>
        <p>Disposition of Excess Gas and Gas Acquired to Meet Deficiency quantities in lines 38 &#8211; 65 are prorated to the rate categories based on the ratio of the Excess or Deficiency quantities for each rate category to the total Excess or Deficiency quantity in line 37.</p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HH7633CD4E75A567054BBBE78A1D58F688" xlink:to="HHD2FA24923ABB0B2BFAF3F08F6DC94239" order="1" />
